<li>Phytolacca acinosa Roxb. (sinonim: P. esculenta Van Houtte, P. latbenia (Moq.) Walter). Black dan Judziewicz melaporkannya di Dane County, Wisconsin dalam buku mereka tahun 2008 dan 2009 (Wildflowers of Wisconsin and the Great Lakes Region. A Comprehensive Field Guide, first and 2nd editions.) – Bayam belanda</li>
<li>Phytolacca americana L. (sinonim: P. decandra L.) – Bayam tinta</li>
